      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 6,
          "actor": "Barron",
          "voiceId": "IcFWazAaBzXNwLWpySgF",
          "text": "[matter-of-factly] Story one. Spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds went net negative this week — about six hundred million dollars out the door across four sessions. First sustained outflow streak since June.",
