          "cues": []
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "actor": "Monk",
          "voiceId": "fATgBRI8wg5KkDFg8vBd",
          "text": "I am pointing out that the wallets which fled in June came back in July and called it conviction. Flow is not belief. Flow is furniture being moved.",
