          "cues": []
        },
        {
          "n": 15,
          "actor": "Monk",
          "voiceId": "fATgBRI8wg5KkDFg8vBd",
          "text": "Agreement. It unsettles you.",
          "directAddress": true,
          "cues": []
        },
        {
          "n": 16,
          "actor": "Barron",
          "voiceId": "IcFWazAaBzXNwLWpySgF",
          "text": "[confidently] Here is the real read. Outflows this size used to break the price. This week they did not. Spot barely moved. When selling stops working, that is the tell.",
          "directAddress": false,
          "cues": []
        },
        {
          "n": 17,
          "actor": "Monk",
          "voiceId": "fATgBRI8wg5KkDFg8vBd",
          "text": "[calmly] Or the buyers are simply quieter than the sellers. Quiet is not the same as strong.",
          "directAddress": true,
          "cues": []
        },
        {
          "n": 18,
          "actor": "Barron",
          "voiceId": "IcFWazAaBzXNwLWpySgF",
          "text": "It is closer than loud.",
